[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
SwallowTail has been installed at:

  swallowtail/

This port contains all SwallowTail service integrations. Enable and start the
services you want on this host:

  sysrc swallowtail_conversion_enable=YES
  sysrc swallowtail_storage_enable=YES
  service swallowtail_conversion start
  service swallowtail_storage start

Service defaults are embedded in the rc.d scripts. Override them in
the system rc configuration using sysrc(8) with swallowtail_conversion_* and
swallowtail_storage_* variables.

An Apache include sample is installed under the package prefix as:

  etc/apache24/Includes/swallowtail.conf.sample

A dedicated PHP-FPM pool is installed under the package prefix as:

  etc/php-fpm.d/swallowtail.conf

Enable the APACHECONF port option to install the active Apache include as:

  etc/apache24/Includes/swallowtail.conf

Without APACHECONF, copy the sample to that path when you are ready. Review the
ServerName and PHP-FPM listener before enabling apache24. The bundled Apache
sample points at the dedicated SwallowTail PHP-FPM pool. Restart php_fpm and
apache24 after changing the active listener or pool settings.
EOM
}
]
